# packages; one that is listed here has this one instead if it is higher (so that an update of a single ontology is one for pkgman).
core 35	# the inverse label of Composition is "contained in" (35; 34: the relation Contains has the nominal name Composition (34; 2: the ontology type has the icon of a folder of relations; 33 was the revision of all packages when it was published))
